                            <comment id="15407236" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 4 Aug 2016 06:05:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This appears to be pretty tough task. As soon as object is converted to binary form we are no longer able to compare it with another binaries since we lost comparison logic.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s keep this ticket on hold for a while, until we came up with clear solution.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15420366" author="vozerov" created="Sun, 14 Aug 2016 15:20:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed by adding special wrappers for these types.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
